{"id": "1536193255379705986", "channel_id": "1536193255379705986", "author_id": "335454645251997717", "author_name": "iwthahe", "content": "I want to pull Horla E3, I don't want Horla E2 to be active because it would make me depressed, and I hate not being able to pull her E3 just because Satan himself (E2) is gatekeeping it. \nHer E2, smite me if I'm lying, reads in plain English: \"You will now sometimes suffer with extra draw, loser lmao\" and I'm not sure how much of an upgrade that is, no other character has such an issue and I'm sure some sorta change would be appreciated.\nAlso Im sure such complaints was voiced before and I wonder what was the devs stance on that?", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T02:03:33.173000+00:00", "thread_id": "1536193255379705986", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-10T02:05:22.263000+00:00", "thread_title": "It's time to complain about Horla E2, never been done before, call me Columbus", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361168939622727801"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1536196151357866095", "channel_id": "1536193255379705986", "author_id": "706262934485073951", "author_name": "bagels5899", "content": "Horla E2 is good actually <:Ramona_tuff_:1441426630420467753> \n\n0 cost you will always play because it is free unless you were planning on not playing any cards that turn for whatever reason???? I guess then you don’t want to stance swap\n2 cost, it will not matter what investment Horla is, be it E0 or AA, 2 cost is probably the first thing you will ever sell at shops and if you get into mob fights before any shop then oh man this 2 cost is seriously weighing me down its not like I want/generally have to end these mob fights quickly and in that timeframe holding one singular card massively holds me back\n\nboth 1 costs at E1 now gain Vuln and Weak application but only for that same turn… and E2 fixes that, you can now hold both 1 costs for your burst turn and when an enemy is about to hit you really hard so you have much greater control about when you apply these statuses\n\nI don’t know if the E2 thing is just a funny bit or if people genuinely believe it is the worst E2 in the game (it is not by far) but yes E2 is actually really strong", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T02:15:03.628000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1536193255379705986", "mentions": ["335454645251997717"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 2}], "reply_to": "1536193255379705986", "thread_title": "It's time to complain about Horla E2, never been done before, call me Columbus", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361168939622727801"]}
